      "created_at": "2020-08-20T08:09:53Z",
      "updated_at": "2020-08-20T08:09:53Z",
      "body": "We're no lawyers and EU cookie law is confusing and contradictory.\r\n\r\nWe believe that the cookies set by pretix (as long as you do not use something like the pretix-tracking or pretix-campaigns plugin) are only used for purposes that can be considered essential for technical purposes (carts, logins, security, language). pretix (by default) does not use cookies for any kind of tracking or profiling purposes, so you should be fine.\r\n\r\nThat said, we *do* plan to add more advanced cookie consent management to pretix at some point, we just haven't got around to it yet and we don't think it's really necessary.",
